<div id="LegacyView_Notice" class="lg-view" style="display: none;"><span id="Legacy_NoticeView_Kind" class="lg-label lg-live" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 94; width: 672; height: 18; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">-</span><span id="Legacy_NoticeView_Title" class="lg-card-title lg-live" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 114; width: 672; height: 26; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">-</span><span id="Legacy_NoticeView_From" class="lg-small lg-live" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 142; width: 672; height: 18; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">-</span><span id="Legacy_NoticeView_Body" class="lg-body lg-live" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 164; width: 672; height: 62; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">-</span><span id="Legacy_NoticeView_WagerHeading" class="lg-heading" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 230; width: 672; height: 20; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">The wager</span><span id="Legacy_NoticeView_Wager" class="lg-small lg-live" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 252; width: 672; height: 148; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">-</span><div id="Legacy_NoticeBack" class="lg-btn" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 430; width: 200; height: 50; "><span id="Legacy_NoticeBack_Label" class="lg-btn-label" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 0; position-top: 13; width: 200; height: 24; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">Back</span></div><div id="Legacy_NoticeAccept" class="lg-btn-primary" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 496; position-top: 430; width: 200; height: 50; "><span id="Legacy_NoticeAccept_Label" class="lg-btn-label" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 0; position-top: 13; width: 200; height: 24; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">Accept the challenge</span></div><div id="Legacy_NoticeAwaiting" class="lg-btn" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 496; position-top: 430; width: 200; height: 50; "><span id="Legacy_NoticeAwaiting_Label" class="lg-btn-label" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 0; position-top: 13; width: 200; height: 24; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">Awaiting the board</span></div></div>
<div id="LegacyView_Accept" class="lg-view" style="display: none;"><span id="Legacy_Accept_Body" class="lg-body-large" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 94; width: 672; height: 46; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">Your house accepts the wager as stated. The match itself still waits for the board.</span><span id="Legacy_Accept_WagerHeading" class="lg-heading" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 146; width: 672; height: 20; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">The wager</span><span id="Legacy_Accept_Wager" class="lg-small lg-live" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 168; width: 672; height: 150; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">-</span><div id="Legacy_AcceptCancel" class="lg-btn" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 430; width: 200; height: 50; "><span id="Legacy_AcceptCancel_Label" class="lg-btn-label" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 0; position-top: 13; width: 200; height: 24; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">Cancel</span></div><div id="Legacy_AcceptConfirm" class="lg-btn-primary" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 496; position-top: 430; width: 200; height: 50; "><span id="Legacy_AcceptConfirm_Label" class="lg-btn-label" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 0; position-top: 13; width: 200; height: 24; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">Accept the challenge</span></div></div>
<div id="LegacyView_Awaiting" class="lg-view" style="display: none;"><span id="Legacy_Awaiting_Body" class="lg-body-large" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 94; width: 672; height: 80; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">The King's Gambit match integration is not connected to My Legacy in this build, so no match can be played or recorded here yet. Your challenge stays open and nothing has been decided.</span><span id="Legacy_Awaiting_Hint" class="lg-body" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 182; width: 672; height: 44; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">Consequences in this build appear only in clearly labelled development previews.</span><span id="Legacy_Awaiting_Readiness" class="lg-heading lg-live" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 234; width: 672; height: 44; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">-</span><div id="Legacy_AwaitingBack" class="lg-btn" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 430; width: 200; height: 50; "><span id="Legacy_AwaitingBack_Label" class="lg-btn-label" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 0; position-top: 13; width: 200; height: 24; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">Back</span></div></div>
<div id="LegacyView_Reset" class="lg-view" style="display: none;"><span id="Legacy_Reset_Body" class="lg-body-large" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 94; width: 672; height: 80; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">Your banner, its members, its chronicle and any captives will be erased from this device. This cannot be undone.</span><div id="Legacy_ResetCancel" class="lg-btn" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 430; width: 200; height: 50; "><span id="Legacy_ResetCancel_Label" class="lg-btn-label" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 0; position-top: 13; width: 200; height: 24; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">Keep the banner</span></div><div id="Legacy_ResetConfirm" class="lg-btn-danger" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 496; position-top: 430; width: 200; height: 50; "><span id="Legacy_ResetConfirm_Label" class="lg-btn-label" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 0; position-top: 13; width: 200; height: 24; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">Dissolve the banner</span></div></div>
<div id="LegacyView_Pause" class="lg-view" style="display: none;"><span id="Legacy_Pause_Reason" class="lg-body-large lg-center lg-live" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 120; width: 672; height: 64; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; font-size: 20;">-</span><span id="Legacy_Pause_Hint" class="lg-body lg-center" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 200; width: 672; height: 60; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">Resume returns you to the same place in My Legacy.</span><div id="Legacy_PauseHome" class="lg-btn" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 24; position-top: 430; width: 200; height: 50; "><span id="Legacy_PauseHome_Label" class="lg-btn-label" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 0; position-top: 13; width: 200; height: 24; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">Return to Home</span></div><div id="Legacy_Resume" class="lg-btn-primary" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 496; position-top: 430; width: 200; height: 50; "><span id="Legacy_Resume_Label" class="lg-btn-label" style="position-type: absolute; position-left: 0; position-top: 13; width: 200; height: 24; pointer-events: none; z-index-offset: 3; ">Resume</span></div></div></div>
